{"title":"Virikh Dragonslayer","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 58 Skeleton that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (1.5% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/grave-rivet\">Grave Rivet</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>887</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>559</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>58</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>423</td><td>36.4</td><td>2,900</td><td class=\"muted\">1,269 · 51 · 8,700</td><td>887</td><td>in the wilds around 2070, 304</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>559</td><td>in the wilds around 2073, 307</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"virikh-dragonslayer\" data-map-level=\"58\">Show level 58 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 7 recorded drops, 827 total, 43–326 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">7 drops</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1433.9px,-1017.4px)\"><img src=\"tiles/3/4/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/4/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/5/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/5/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:1024px\"><i style=\"left:1429.7px;top:985.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:1418.3px;top:991.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1428.3px;top:994.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1446.5px;top:1045.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1391.8px;top:993.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:1439.9px;top:1076.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:1427.6px;top:1017.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1414.8px;top:1003.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1439.1px;top:1046.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1420.3px;top:1016.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1456.1px;top:1000.4